<p>Get access permissions for a page</p>

<b>Get parameters</b>
<ul><li> action = "getAccess"</li>
<li> pageName = Page name to get access permissions for</li>
</ul>
<b>Get examples:</b>
<xmp class="panel" of-exclude="true">
// Simple URL
/OpenForum/Actions/Access?action=getAccess&pageName=/OpenForum/Actions/Access

// Using JSON.get
JSON.get('/OpenForum/Actions/Access', 'getAccess', 'pageName=/OpenForum/Actions/Access')
  .onSuccess(function(result) {
    console.log('Access:', result);
  }).go();
</xmp>


<h3>Access</h3>

